\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Can square complex matrices be multiplied in $O_\varepsilon (n^{9/4+\varepsilon })$ arithmetic operations for every fixed $\varepsilon >0$, equivalently is the complex matrix-multiplication exponent at most 9/4?

